---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import StickyHeader from '../components/StickyHeader.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Tampa Kitchen Cabinets" description="How Tampa Kitchen Cabinets collects, uses, and protects your information." noindex={true}>
  <main class="bg-white min-h-screen">
    <StickyHeader />
    <section class="pt-32 pb-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 article-content">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1a2b4a] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: May 2026</p>
        <p>{site.brandName} ("we", "us"), a division of {site.legalEntity}, respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it when you visit {site.domain} or request an estimate.</p>
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit a form or call us, we collect the details you provide, such as your name, phone number, email address, property address, and project details. We may also collect standard analytics data (pages visited, device, and approximate location) through cookies and tools like Google Analytics.</p>
        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your request and schedule a free estimate</li>
          <li>To communicate about your project, including calls, texts, and emails you opt into</li>
          <li>To improve our website and services</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share it with service providers who help us operate (for example, our customer-management and financing partners such as Acorn Finance) only as needed to serve you.</p>
        <h2>Text messages</h2>
        <p>If you opt in to text updates, message and data rates may apply. You can opt out at any time by replying STOP.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You may request access to or deletion of your information, or opt out of marketing communications, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>{site.legalEntity}, {site.address.street}, {site.address.city}, {site.address.region} {site.address.postalCode}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Footer />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
